sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant KC as Keycloak
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (FastAPI)

    Admin->>KC: 1: Creates 'analyst' role
    Admin->>KC: 2: Assigns 'analyst' role to user
    Admin->>KC: 3: Configures client to add 'roles' claim to token

    User->>FE: 4: Logs into the application (full OIDC flow)
    FE->>FE: 5: Decodes ID Token, finds 'roles: ["analyst"]'
    FE->>FE: 6: Conditionally renders "Analyst Dashboard" button
    User->>FE: 7: Clicks button to fetch protected data
    FE->>+BE: 8: GET /api/v1/analyst-data
    Note over BE: Request headers include 'X-User-Roles: analyst'
    BE->>BE: 9: Verifies 'analyst' is in roles header
    BE-->>-FE: 10: Returns protected data
    FE->>User: 11: Displays analyst data